    "Only mode eligibility changes: SURVIVAL/ADVENTURE already permitted; CREATIVE/SPECTATOR no longer rejected solely by mode. No mode grants, permission changes or synthetic completion. Mode-specific previously-denied cohort is measured as before0; the same UUID could previously switch to Survival, so this is not a forecast of wholly new players.",
